(Bug #27 regression: a Repeat inside a function body, followed by another
 statement in the same body. Before the fix the period after "r" did not
 close the Repeat, so "after" was absorbed as a per-iteration action and
 the call printed `r after r after`. The fix makes the period end the
 Repeat, so "after" is the function's second statement and runs once,
 after the loop. Expected: r, r, after.)

To twice.
  Repeat 2 times, Print "r".
  Print "after".

twice.